    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" ... sounds nice. but it feels impossible. i feel like i've been fighting for so long and there's nothing left in the tank. like i've done everything i was supposed to do and i'm still just... stuck in this cycle. it feels like i'm just running in place until i die anyway.",
