    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop trying to run\"... is that even possible though? i mean, if i stop, everything just collapses. the people around me, the stuff i have to do... it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and the weight is to just... leave it all behind completely. like, is there even a version of this where i actually get to rest?",
